# DispatchKeySet 伪代码

## 文件概述
来源: c10/core/DispatchKeySet.h, c10/core/DispatchKeySet.cpp

DispatchKeySet 是 PyTorch 调度系统的核心数据结构，用 64 位整数表示一组 DispatchKey。它同时包含"功能位"（functionality bits，如 Dense、Sparse、Autograd）和"后端位"（backend bits，如 CPU、CUDA）。

---

## 1. 核心数据结构

--------------------------------
DispatchKeySet
来源: DispatchKeySet.h
--------------------------------

【状态】
    repr_: uint64                    # 64位位集，编码所有 DispatchKey

【位布局】
    位 [0, num_backends):            后端位 (CPUBit, CUDABit, ...)
    位 [num_backends, 64):           功能位 (Dense, Sparse, Autograd, ...)

【构造】
    DispatchKeySet()用途: 默认构造，repr_ = 0

    DispatchKeySet(DispatchKey k)
        用途: 从单个 DispatchKey 构造
        算法:
            if k == Undefined:
                repr_ = 0
            else if k <= EndOfFunctionalityKeys:
                # 纯功能键（如 AutogradOther, FuncTorchBatched）
                functionality_val = 1ULL << (num_backends + k - 1)
                repr_ = functionality_val
            else if k <= EndOfRuntimeBackendKeys:
                # 运行时键（如 CPU, AutogradCPU）
                functionality_k = toFunctionalityKey(k)
                functionality_val = 1ULL << (num_backends + functionality_k - 1)
                backend_k = toBackendComponent(k)
                backend_val = (backend_k == InvalidBit) ? 0 : 1ULL << (backend_k - 1)
                repr_ = functionality_val + backend_val
            else:
                # 别名键不支持
                repr_ = 0

    DispatchKeySet(BackendComponent b)
        用途: 从后端组件构造
        算法:
            repr_ = (b == InvalidBit) ? 0 : 1ULL << (b - 1)

    DispatchKeySet(initializer_list<DispatchKey> ks)
        用途: 从多个 DispatchKey 构造
        算法:
            repr_ = 0
            for k in ks:
                repr_ |= DispatchKeySet(k).repr_

    DispatchKeySet(FULL)
        用途: 构造包含所有键的集合
        算法:
            repr_ = (1ULL << (num_backends + num_functionality_keys - 1)) - 1

    DispatchKeySet(FULL_AFTER, DispatchKey t)
        用途: 构造包含 t 之后所有功能键的集合
        算法:
            repr_ = (1ULL << (num_backends + toFunctionalityKey(t) - 1)) - 1
            *this = add(DispatchKey::PythonDispatcher)

【查询】
    has(DispatchKey t) -> bool
        用途: 检查是否包含 t
        算法:
            return has_all(DispatchKeySet(t))

    has_backend(BackendComponent t) -> bool
        用途: 检查是否包含后端位 t
        算法:
            return has_all(DispatchKeySet(t))

    has_all(DispatchKeySet ks) -> bool
        用途: 检查是否包含 ks 的所有位
        算法:
            return (repr_ & ks.repr_) == ks.repr_

    has_any(DispatchKeySet ks) -> bool
        用途: 检查是否包含 ks 的任意位
        约束: ks 不应同时包含后端位和 per-backend 功能位
        算法:
            return (repr_ & ks.repr_) != 0

    empty() -> bool
        用途: 检查集合是否为空
        算法:
            return repr_ == 0

【集合操作】
    operator|(DispatchKeySet other) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 集合并集
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet(repr_ | other.repr_)

    operator&(DispatchKeySet other) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 集合交集
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet(repr_ & other.repr_)

    operator-(DispatchKeySet other) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 集合差集（仅移除功能位，保留后端位）
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet(repr_ & (full_backend_mask | ~other.repr_))

    operator^(DispatchKeySet other) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 集合异或
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet(repr_ ^ other.repr_)

    add(DispatchKey t) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 添加 DispatchKey（不可变）
        算法:
            return *this | DispatchKeySet(t)

    remove(DispatchKey t) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 移除 DispatchKey 的功能位（不可变）
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet(repr_ & ~(DispatchKeySet(t).repr_ & ~full_backend_mask))

    remove_backend(BackendComponent b) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 移除后端位（不可变）
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet(repr_ & ~DispatchKeySet(b).repr_)

【优先级查询】
    highestFunctionalityKey() -> DispatchKey
        用途: 返回最高优先级的功能键
        算法:
            functionality_idx = indexOfHighestBit()
            if functionality_idx < num_backends:
                return Undefined
            return DispatchKey(functionality_idx - num_backends)

    highestBackendKey() -> BackendComponent
        用途: 返回最高优先级的后端键
        算法:
            backend_idx = DispatchKeySet(repr_ & full_backend_mask).indexOfHighestBit()
            if backend_idx == 0:
                return InvalidBit
            return BackendComponent(backend_idx)

    highestPriorityTypeId() -> DispatchKey
        用途: 返回最高优先级的运行时 DispatchKey
        算法:
            functionality_k = highestFunctionalityKey()
            if isPerBackendFunctionalityKey(functionality_k):
                return toRuntimePerBackendFunctionalityKey(functionality_k, highestBackendKey())
            return functionality_k

    indexOfHighestBit() -> uint8
        用途: 返回最高位的索引
        算法:
            return 64 - llvm::countLeadingZeros(repr_)

【调度表索引】
    getDispatchTableIndexForDispatchKeySet() -> int
        用途: 计算运行时调度表索引
        算法:
            # 提取功能位索引
            functionality_idx = DispatchKeySet(repr_ >> num_backends).indexOfHighestBit()
            offset_and_mask = offsetsAndMasks()[functionality_idx]

            # 提取后端位索引
            backend_idx = DispatchKeySet((repr_ & offset_and_mask.mask) >> 1).indexOfHighestBit()

            return offset_and_mask.offset + backend_idx

    getBackendIndex() -> uint64
        用途: 返回最高优先级后端的索引
        算法:
            return DispatchKeySet((repr_ & full_backend_mask) >> 1).indexOfHighestBit()

【迭代器】
    begin() -> iterator
        用途: 返回指向第一个 DispatchKey 的迭代器

    end() -> iterator
        用途: 返回结束迭代器

【备注】
    - 后端位和功能位的组合形成运行时键（如 CPUBit + Dense = CPU）
    - 移除操作只影响功能位，后端位保持不变
    - 迭代器遍历所有运行时 DispatchKey，对 per-backend 功能会展开所有后端

---

## 2. 迭代器实现

--------------------------------
DispatchKeySet::iterator
来源: DispatchKeySet.h, DispatchKeySet.cpp
--------------------------------

【状态】
    data_ptr_: const uint64*                    # 指向 DispatchKeySet.repr_
    next_functionality_: uint8                  # 下一个功能位索引
    next_backend_: uint8                        # 下一个后端位索引
    current_dispatchkey_idx_: uint8             # 当前功能键索引
    current_backendcomponent_idx_: uint8        # 当前后端组件索引

【算法】
    operator++() -> iterator&
        用途: 前进到下一个 DispatchKey
        算法:
            # Step 1: 屏蔽已遍历的位
            masked_functionality_bits = llvm::maskTrailingZeros(next_functionality_) & *data_ptr_
            masked_backend_bits = llvm::maskTrailingZeros(next_backend_) & full_backend_mask & *data_ptr_

            # Step 2: 找到下一个设置的位
            first_functionality_idx = llvm::findFirstSet(masked_functionality_bits)
            first_backendcomponent_idx = llvm::findFirstSet(masked_backend_bits)

            # Step 3: 检查是否到达末尾
            if first_functionality_idx == max_uint64 or next_functionality_ == end_iter_mask_val:
                # 设置为 end() 状态
                next_functionality_ = end_iter_mask_val
                current_dispatchkey_idx_ = end_iter_key_val
                next_backend_ = 0
                current_backendcomponent_idx_ = end_iter_key_val
                return *this

            # Step 4: 计算新索引
            new_next_functionality = first_functionality_idx + 1
            new_backendcomponent_idx = first_backendcomponent_idx + 1
            next_dispatchkey_idx = new_next_functionality - num_backends

            # Step 5: 处理 per-backend 功能键
            if isPerBackendFunctionalityKey(DispatchKey(next_dispatchkey_idx)):
                if first_backendcomponent_idx == max_uint64:
                    # 没有后端位，跳过此功能键
                    next_functionality_ = new_next_functionality
                    ++(*this)
                    return *this

                # 设置当前键
                current_dispatchkey_idx_ = next_dispatchkey_idx
                current_backendcomponent_idx_ = new_backendcomponent_idx

                # 查找下一个后端位
                next_backendcomponent_bits = llvm::maskTrailingZeros(first_backendcomponent_idx + 1) & full_backend_mask & *data_ptr_
                next_backendcomponent_idx = llvm::findFirstSet(next_backendcomponent_bits)

                if next_backendcomponent_idx == max_uint64:
                    # 没有更多后端，前进功能位
                    next_functionality_ = new_next_functionality
                    next_backend_ = 0
                else:
                    # 保持功能位，前进后端位
                    next_backend_ = first_backendcomponent_idx + 1
            else:
                # 非 per-backend 功能键
                current_dispatchkey_idx_ = next_dispatchkey_idx
                next_functionality_ = new_next_functionalityreturn *this

    operator*() -> DispatchKey
        用途: 解引用，返回当前 DispatchKey
        算法:
            functionality_key = DispatchKey(current_dispatchkey_idx_)
            if isPerBackendFunctionalityKey(functionality_key):
                return toRuntimePerBackendFunctionalityKey(
                    functionality_key,
                    BackendComponent(current_backendcomponent_idx_)
                )
            else:
                return functionality_key

【备注】
    - 迭代顺序：先遍历功能位（从低到高），对每个 per-backend 功能位遍历所有后端位
    - 例如：如果 keyset 包含 AutogradFunctionality + CPUBit + CUDABit，会依次返回 AutogradCPU, AutogradCUDA

---

## 3. 全局常量与辅助函数

--------------------------------
预定义 DispatchKeySet 常量
来源: DispatchKeySet.h, DispatchKeySet.cpp
--------------------------------

【常量】
    autograd_dispatch_keyset = {AutogradFunctionality, AutogradOther, AutogradNestedTensor}用途: 所有 autograd 功能键（不含后端位）

    autocast_dispatch_keyset = {AutocastCPU, AutocastMPS, AutocastCUDA, ...}
        用途: 所有 autocast 键

    backend_dispatch_keyset = autogradother_backends | {Dense}
        用途: 所有后端调度键（CompositeExplicitAutograd 映射到此）

    non_functional_backend_dispatch_keyset = backend_dispatch_keyset - {Sparse, XLABit, LazyBit}
        用途: 非函数式后端键（CompositeExplicitAutogradNonFunctional 映射到此）

    math_dispatch_keyset = backend_dispatch_keyset | autograd_dispatch_keyset | {NestedTensor, Functionalize}
        用途: 数学调度键（CompositeImplicitAutograd 映射到此）

    nested_dispatch_keyset = {AutogradNestedTensor, NestedTensor} | full_backend_mask
        用途: NestedTensor 相关键

    autogradother_backends = {FPGA, MAIA, Vulkan, Metal, CustomRNGKeyId, MkldnnCPU, Sparse, SparseCsr, Quantized} | full_backend_mask
        用途: 映射到 AutogradOther 的后端

    after_autograd_keyset = FULL_AFTER(AutogradOther)
        用途: autograd 之后的所有键

    after_ADInplaceOrView_keyset = FULL_AFTER(ADInplaceOrView)
        用途: ADInplaceOrView 之后的所有键

    after_func_keyset = FULL_AFTER(Functionalize) - {ADInplaceOrView}
        用途: Functionalize 之后的所有键（移除 ADInplaceOrView）

    backend_functionality_keys = {Dense, Quantized, Sparse, SparseCsr} | full_backend_mask
        用途: 所有后端功能键

    functorch_transforms_ks = {FuncTorchBatched, FuncTorchVmapMode, Batched, VmapMode, FuncTorchGradWrapper}
        用途: functorch 变换键

【函数】
    isBackendDispatchKey(DispatchKey t) -> bool
        用途: 判断是否为后端调度键
        算法:
            return t != Undefined
                and not isAliasDispatchKey(t)
                and t != NestedTensor
                and backend_dispatch_keyset.has(t)

    getRuntimeDispatchKeySet(DispatchKey t) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 将别名键解析为运行时键集
        算法:
            match t:
                Autograd:
                    return autograd_dispatch_keyset | full_backend_mask
                CompositeImplicitAutograd:
                    return math_dispatch_keyset
                CompositeImplicitAutogradNestedTensor:
                    return nested_dispatch_keyset
                CompositeExplicitAutograd:
                    return backend_dispatch_keyset
                CompositeExplicitAutogradNonFunctional:
                    return non_functional_backend_dispatch_keyset
                default:
                    return DispatchKeySet(t)

    runtimeDispatchKeySetHas(DispatchKey t, DispatchKey k) -> bool
        用途: 检查别名键 t 是否包含 k
        算法:
            match t:
                Autograd:
                    return autograd_dispatch_keyset.has(toFunctionalityKey(k))
                CompositeImplicitAutograd:
                    return math_dispatch_keyset.has(k)
                CompositeImplicitAutogradNestedTensor:
                    return nested_dispatch_keyset.has(k)
                CompositeExplicitAutograd:
                    return k != NestedTensor and backend_dispatch_keyset.has(k)
                CompositeExplicitAutogradNonFunctional:
                    return k != NestedTensor and non_functional_backend_dispatch_keyset.has(k)
                FuncTorchBatchedDecomposition:
                    return functorch_batched_ks.has(k)
                default:
                    return t == k

    getBackendKeySetFromAutograd(DispatchKey t) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 从 autograd 键获取关联的后端键
        算法:
            match t:
                AutogradCPU: return {CPU}
                AutogradCUDA: return {CUDA}
                AutogradXLA: return {XLA}
                AutogradLazy: return {Lazy}
                AutogradMeta: return {Meta}
                AutogradMPS: return {MPS}
                AutogradHPU: return {HPU}
                AutogradIPU: return {IPU}
                AutogradXPU: return {XPU}
                AutogradPrivateUse1: return {PrivateUse1}
                AutogradPrivateUse2: return {PrivateUse2}
                AutogradPrivateUse3: return {PrivateUse3}
                AutogradNestedTensor: return {NestedTensor} | full_backend_mask
                AutogradOther: return autogradother_backends
                default: return {}

    isIncludedInAlias(DispatchKey k, DispatchKey alias) -> bool
        用途: 检查 k 是否包含在别名 alias 中
        算法:
            return k != Undefined and runtimeDispatchKeySetHas(alias, k)

    getAutogradRelatedKeySetFromBackend(BackendComponent t) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 从后端获取关联的 autograd 键
        算法:
            match t:
                CPUBit: return {ADInplaceOrView, AutogradCPU}
                CUDABit: return {ADInplaceOrView, AutogradCUDA}
                XLABit: return {ADInplaceOrView, AutogradXLA}
                ...
                default: return {ADInplaceOrView, AutogradOther}

    getAutocastRelatedKeySetFromBackend(BackendComponent t) -> DispatchKeySet
        用途: 从后端获取关联的 autocast 键
        算法:
            match t:
                CPUBit: return {AutocastCPU}
                CUDABit: return {AutocastCUDA}
                XLABit: return {AutocastXLA}
                ...
                default: return {}

    highestPriorityBackendTypeId(DispatchKeySet ks) -> DispatchKey
        用途: 返回最高优先级的后端类型 ID
        算法:
            return (ks & backend_functionality_keys).highestPriorityTypeId()

    legacyExtractDispatchKey(DispatchKeySet s) -> DispatchKey
        用途: 从 keyset 提取传统的单个 DispatchKey（移除 autograd/autocast/functorch 等）
        算法:
            return (s - autograd_dispatch_keyset_with_ADInplaceOrView- autocast_dispatch_keyset
                      - {Functionalize, PythonTLSSnapshot, FuncTorchGradWrapper, FuncTorchVmapMode, FuncTorchBatched, Python}
                   ).highestPriorityTypeId()

    toString(DispatchKeySet ts) -> string
        用途: 转换为字符串表示
        算法:
            if ts.empty():
                return "DispatchKeySet()"
            result = "DispatchKeySet("
            for k in ts:
                result += toString(k) + ", "
            return result + ")"

【备注】
    - 别名键（如 Autograd, CompositeImplicitAutograd）在运行时会展开为多个实际键
    - full_backend_mask 是所有后端位的掩码

---

## 4. 功能偏移量计算

--------------------------------
initializeFunctionalityOffsetsAndMasks
来源: DispatchKeySet.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    initializeFunctionalityOffsetsAndMasks() -> array<FunctionalityOffsetAndMask, num_functionality_keys>

【算法】
    # 初始化偏移量和掩码数组
    offsets_and_masks[0] = FunctionalityOffsetAndMask(0, 0)  # Undefined

    for functionality_idx in range(1, num_functionality_keys):
        prev_offset_and_mask = offsets_and_masks[functionality_idx - 1]
        k = DispatchKey(functionality_idx)

        # 计算下一个偏移量
        if prev_offset_and_mask.mask == 0:
            # 前一个不是 per-backend，偏移量 +1
            next_offset = prev_offset_and_mask.offset + 1
        else:
            # 前一个是 per-backend，偏移量 +num_backends
            next_offset = prev_offset_and_mask.offset + num_backends

        # 计算掩码
        if isPerBackendFunctionalityKey(k):
            next_mask = full_backend_mask
        else:
            next_mask = 0

        offsets_and_masks[functionality_idx] = FunctionalityOffsetAndMask(next_offset, next_mask)

    # 验证最后一个偏移量
    assert offsets_and_masks[num_functionality_keys - 1].offset == num_runtime_entries - 1

    return offsets_and_masks

【用途】
    为每个功能键计算其在运行时调度表中的偏移量和后端掩码

【备注】
    - per-backend 功能键（如 Dense, Autograd）占用 num_backends 个槽位
    - 非 per-backend 功能键（如 FuncTorchBatched）占用 1 个槽位
    - 偏移量用于 getDispatchTableIndexForDispatchKeySet() 计算
